        "Content": "Built c.1997\nReady for immediate move in\nNo onward property chain allowing new owners to move without delay\n3 Bedroom 3 Bathroom\nQuiet cul de sac location\nExtends to circa 100 sq.m. / 1,076 sq.ft.\nSolid built shed\n\n\n"
      },
